<td>Pass</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Overall,\xA0my\xA0feedback\xA0is\xA0that\xA0the\xA0question\xA0is\xA0straightforward,\xA0relevant,\xA0focused,\xA0and\xA0includes\xA0all\xA0the\xA0necessary\xA0information.\xA0The\xA0title\xA0is\xA0sufficiently\xA0clear\xA0and\xA0concise,\xA0and\xA0the\xA0question\xA0contains\xA0enough\xA0information\xA0to\xA0help\xA0other\xA0users\xA0understand\xA0the\xA0issue.\xA0No\xA0improvements\xA0are\xA0required.</p>
<p>Grade:\xA0Pass.</p>
<ol>
<li>\xA0What\xA0is\xA0the\xA0title\xA0of\xA0the\xA0question?</li>
<li>\xA0Does\xA0the\xA0title\xA0follow\xA0the\xA0quality\xA0standards\xA0for\xA0a\xA0good\xA0question?</li>
<li>\xA0What\xA0information\xA0is\xA0available\xA0in\xA0the\xA0body\xA0of\xA0the\xA0question?</li>
<li>\xA0Does\xA0this\xA0question\xA0follow\xA0the\xA0quality\xA0standards\xA0for\xA0a\xA0good\xA0question?</li>
<li>\xA0Is\xA0there\xA0anything\xA0that\xA0they\xA0can\xA0improve\xA0in\xA0the\xA0question\xA0to\xA0make\xA0it\xA0a\xA0better\xA0question?\xA0Why\xA0or\xA0why\xA0not?</li>
<li>\xA0&quot;Windows\xA0Virtual\xA0Desktop\xA0peering\xA0with\xA0Azure\xA0VNET\xA0to\xA0our\xA0OnPremise\xA0network?&quot;</li>
<li>\xA0Yes,\xA0the\xA0title\xA0follows\xA0the\xA0quality\xA0standards\xA0for\xA0a\xA0good\xA0question.\xA0It\xA0includes\xA0Service,\xA0Scenario,\xA0and\xA0Result\xA0elements.</li>
<li>\xA0The\xA0body\xA0of\xA0the\xA0question\xA0asks\xA0whether\xA0it\xA0is\xA0possible\xA0for\xA0the\xA0Windows\xA0Virtual\xA0Desktop\xA0VM\xA0to\xA0peer\xA0with\xA0an\xA0Azure\xA0VNET\xA0that\xA0is\xA0peered\xA0with\xA0an\xA0ExpressRoute\xA0back\xA0to\xA0OnPremise.\xA0It\xA0also\xA0asks\xA0about\xA0the\xA0steps\xA0and\xA0consequences\xA0of\xA0peering\xA0WVD,\xA0as\xA0opposed\xA0to\xA0deploying\xA0a\xA0traditional\xA0Azure\xA0Windows\xA0Desktop\xA0VM\xA0in\xA0Azure.\xA0Additionally,\xA0the\xA0author\xA0asks\xA0about\xA0the\xA0security\xA0implications\xA0and\xA0suggests\xA0deploying\xA0Azure\xA0Bastion\xA0to\xA0control\xA0access\xA0to\xA0the\xA0virtual\xA0machine.</li>
<li>\xA0Yes,\xA0the\xA0question\xA0follows\xA0the\xA0quality\xA0standards\xA0for\xA0a\xA0good\xA0question.\xA0It\xA0is\xA0clear\xA0and\xA0concise,\xA0includes\xA0all\xA0relevant\xA0information,\xA0is\xA0focused\xA0and\xA0optimized\xA0for\xA0the\xA0target\xA0audience\xA0(the\xA0Azure\xA0community).</li>
<li>\xA0No,\xA0there\xA0is\xA0no\xA0need\xA0for\xA0improvement\xA0as\xA0the\xA0question\xA0meets\xA0all\xA0quality\xA0standards\xA0for\xA0a\xA0good\xA0question.\xA0It\xA0includes\xA0all\xA0the\xA0necessary\xA0components,\xA0is\xA0focused\xA0and\xA0clear,\xA0and\xA0contains\xA0sufficient\xA0detail\xA0to\xA0help\xA0other\xA0users\xA0understand\xA0the\xA0issue.\xA0It\xA0is\xA0optimized\xA0for\xA0the\xA0target\xA0audience\xA0and\xA0includes\xA0all\xA0relevant\xA0information,\xA0including\xA0system\xA0and\xA0configuration\xA0requirements,\xA0environment\xA0details,\xA0and\xA0supporting\xA0materials.&lt;|im_end|&gt;</li>
</ol>

